* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_afshp (reference/crafted.toml, 19 Nov 2026): demo12 plus shaped
* availability factors in REG1 (coef_cpt.mod L42-62, pp_shapr.mod L19-46; M1.3 change 66), which no
* open model has:
* - SHAPE rows 2 (decline with age) and 3 (a first year at 0.8), MULTI row 2 (0.95 in 2030, 0.9 in 2050);
* - NCAP_AFX 2 on the vintaged gas plant ELCTNGAS01 (NCAP_AF by DAYNITE slice) and NCAP_AFX 3 with
*   NCAP_AFM 2 on the existing wind plant ELCREWIN00, not vintaged, which NCAP_AFX makes
*   vintage-dependent (L43-47, the NCAP_AF shape of L48);
* - NCAP_AFS at ANNUAL with NCAP_AFSX 2 on the nuclear plant ELCNNNUC01; seasonal NCAP_AFS with
*   NCAP_AFSX 3 and NCAP_AFM 2 on the solar plant ELCRNSOL01, which L42 marks for the NCAP_AF
*   shape and L55 copies into NCAP_AFSM (setglobs.gms declares NCAP_AFSM after the data, so it
*   cannot be given; life 15 years: its 2050 vintage is around for one period only, L27); a seasonal NCAP_AFS on ELCTNGAS01, which takes its
*   NCAP_AFX as NCAP_AFSX (L58) (the NCAP_AFS shape of L59).
* The year-0 records (3) extend each index back and forward to every vintage (preshape.gms).
